A comment between a term and its description is the description's first block

```
:: t
  %%%
      a
  %%%
:  body
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>body</dd>
</dl>
```

```
:: t
%%%
a
%%%
: body
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>body</dd>
</dl>
```

```
:: t
%%%
a
%%%
:: u
: body
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dt>u</dt>
  <dd>body</dd>
</dl>
```

```
:: t
%% c
: body
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dd>body</dd>
</dl>
```

```
:: t
%% c
:: u
: body
.
<dl>
  <dt>t</dt>
  <dt>u</dt>
  <dd>body</dd>
</dl>
```
